S=[
("business-website-design","Business Website Design","A clear, credible home for your business online.","Many business sites look dated, hide what customers need, or fall apart on phones.","We organise your offer around what visitors look for, then design a site that explains it quickly and makes contacting you easy.","Custom page designs|Content structure and navigation|Contact and enquiry setup|Responsive layouts|Basic SEO setup","Can I supply my own text and photos?","Yes. We format what you provide and can advise where more content would help."),
("corporate-website-design","Corporate Website Design","Structured, professional sites for established organisations.","Larger organisations often need many services, teams and audiences explained without overwhelming visitors.","We build a clear information architecture, a consistent design system and pages that scale as the company grows.","Site map and page templates|Design system|Service and team pages|Multi-section navigation|Performance and SEO foundations","How many pages can a corporate site have?","As many as the scope needs. The Premium package covers up to ten, and larger sites are quoted individually."),
("ecommerce-website-design","E-commerce Website Design","Online stores designed to make buying simple.","Shoppers leave when browsing is confusing, product pages are thin, or checkout feels uncertain.","We design catalogue, product and cart experiences around how people actually shop, with clear imagery, filtering and calls to action.","Catalogue and product page design|Cart and checkout flow design|Search and filtering interface|Mobile shopping experience|Payment gateway integration (add-on)","Which payment providers do you integrate?","Integration is quoted per provider. Provider fees are billed to you directly by that service."),
("landing-page-design","Landing Page Design","Focused single pages built for one clear action.","Campaign traffic is wasted when a page tries to say everything and asks for nothing.","We write and design one focused page around one goal, with a clear message, proof where you have it and a single main call to action.","One-page custom design|Conversion-focused copy structure|Lead form or contact setup|Mobile-first layout|Analytics integration (add-on)","What is the difference between a landing page and a website?","A landing page serves one goal and one audience. A website covers the whole business."),
("custom-website-development","Custom Website Development","Hand-built code, no template underneath.","Template sites can be slow, bloated and difficult to adapt when your needs change.","We write clean HTML, CSS and JavaScript, and use React or Node.js when a project genuinely needs them, so you get a fast site you fully own.","Hand-written front-end code|Interactive components|Forms and integrations|Source files delivered to you|Deployment assistance","Do I get the source code?","Yes. Once the project is paid in full you receive the files and full rights to use them."),
("website-redesign","Website Redesign","A fresher, more effective version of the site you already have.","An outdated site can undermine a good business: slow pages, unclear messaging and poor mobile layouts.","We review what exists, keep what works and rebuild the rest with modern design, clearer structure and better performance.","Review of the current site|New visual design|Restructured content|Responsive rebuild|Redirect and launch checklist","Will I lose my search rankings?","We plan redirects and keep valuable page addresses where possible, but we cannot promise any ranking outcome."),
("ui-ux-design","UI/UX Design","Interfaces that are clear, consistent and easy to use.","Confusing navigation and inconsistent interfaces make people give up before they reach what they came for.","We map user journeys, then design screens and components that are consistent, accessible and easy to build.","User flow mapping|Wireframes|Visual design for key screens|Reusable component set|Accessibility review","Can you design without building?","Yes. Design-only projects are quoted separately."),
("responsive-development","Responsive Development","Layouts that work on every screen size.","Sites designed only for desktop leave most phone visitors pinching and scrolling sideways.","We build mobile-first, then scale up for tablets, laptops and large monitors, testing real widths rather than just resizing a browser.","Mobile-first layouts|Tablet and desktop adaptations|Touch-friendly navigation|Fluid typography and spacing|Cross-device checks","Which devices do you test on?","We test across common phone, tablet and desktop widths and in the major browsers before launch."),
("website-optimization","Website Optimization","Faster pages and cleaner foundations.","Slow pages and unoptimised images frustrate visitors and make a site harder to find.","We audit what slows your site, compress and resize assets, tidy the code and fix technical SEO basics.","Speed audit|Image compression and sizing|Code clean-up|Technical SEO basics|Accessibility fixes","Can you guarantee a performance score?","No. We can show before and after measurements, but scores vary by test and device."),
("website-maintenance","Website Maintenance","Ongoing care so your site stays current.","Sites decay quietly: content goes stale, small bugs linger and nobody is responsible for fixes.","A monthly plan gives you a named person for updates, small changes and checks, so the site keeps doing its job.","Content and text updates|Small design changes|Regular checks|Bug fixes|Priority contact on Telegram","What does maintenance cost?","Monthly maintenance is an add-on at the rate shown in the pricing calculator.")]
